{"id":"vod_sn_38643","vodId":"38643","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魍魉之匣","name_cn":"魍魉之匣","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/84af907ab984076096b521d16268b61c.jpg"},"summary":"楠木赖子（高桥美佳子 配音）是个14岁的初中生，在班上没什么朋友，但偶然得到班上极为耀目的美少女柚木加菜子（戸松遥 配音）的青睐，两人成为朋友，不料相约乘电车去看湖时飞来横祸，加莱子落下站台被列车轧成重伤。刑警木场修太郎（关贵昭 配音）调查此案，发现加莱子似乎有着神秘的重要身 份，同时以多摩为中心，整片地区陆续发现许多被分尸的尸体残块，关注整个事件的中禅寺敦子（桑岛法子 配音）、关口巽（木内秀信 配音）、鸟口守彦（浪川大辅 配音）为了写出内幕报道，调查中在森林中发现古怪建筑物，如巨大的匣子，一切谜底的最终还要靠京极堂（平田広明 配音）揭开……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JLcVtMJXYM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RtrwUdTkdW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1QV5RBDCh81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ycGfupmW5M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mhu30Jqj0j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HZt78Cgxuq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1SbcxxN8Su1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zL9RrQq56m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5QLdgnXudz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M8pBjE9ZXN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c3wXprhMPu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yhTukv2rcp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KnanRZxaCE1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:56.341Z"}